# Runtime state written when the backend runs from the source folder (COD4X_DATA_ROOT
# defaults to "."): users with password hashes and TOTP secrets, sessions, alert
# settings with the Discord webhook and the VAPID private key, push subscriptions,
# audit log and monitor history. Only the two shipped defaults stay tracked.
